  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.024pt, 83.18pt, "1. Introduction ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(107.42pt, 110.78pt, "The increasing demand for electricity and the environmental pollution associated with ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 138.38pt, "fossil fuels require advancements in the energy system [1]. Thoroughly planned domestic ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 165.98pt, "renewable energy generation could decrease dependencies and reduce environmental pollution [2]. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 193.58pt, "However, integrating renewable energy sources with fluctuating power generation into the electric ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 221.18pt, "grid is challenging, as they are increasingly problematic to balance with fossil generation alone. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 248.81pt, "Energy storage systems, such as pumped hydro storage, offer a suitable solution with high round-")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 276.41pt, "trip efficiency and minimal environmental impact [3] to compensate for predictable daily ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 304.01pt, "fluctuations. However, large-scale batteries are more tolerant of rapid switching on and off with ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 331.61pt, "low response time [4]. The low availability and ethical issues surrounding the mining process of ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 359.21pt, "minerals used in Li-ion batteries draw attention to other emerging technologies [5], such as Na-S ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 386.81pt, "or vanadium-redox flow batteries (VRFBs). The latter offers advantages in terms of the abundance ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 414.43pt, "of cell materials [6], with a lifetime exceeding 20,000 cycles [7], particularly with electrolyte ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 442.03pt, "rebalancing [8]. VRFBs have low fire risk due to the near-room-temperature water-based ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 469.63pt, "electrolyte; meanwhile, their response time is in the range of milliseconds [9]. ")
  #line-at(108.02pt, 497.23pt, "The electrolyte is stored in separate tanks, from which the pumps force it into the cells, ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 524.83pt, "where reactions occur. Thanks to the unique architecture, the energy capacity and power rating ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 552.43pt, "can be designed independently from each other for the desired application. Despite the clearly ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 580.06pt, "advantageous properties of VRFBs, further development is necessary, which underscores the need ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 607.66pt, "for modeling [10]. ")
  #line-at(114.62pt, 635.26pt, "Lumped parameter models are suitable for system-level simulations and determination of ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 662.86pt, "system efficiency [11], [12]. Since chemical, electrical, fluid dynamics, and thermal processes are ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 690.46pt, "highly interconnected, a comprehensive model is typically required. To accurately determine ")
]

